  "description": "A medical treatment used to kill cancer cells, often involving harsh side effects and high costs. It is a serious, life-altering treatment that is not trivial or humorous. The meme references it to create dark humor by equating the cost of Christmas presents with the cost of this treatment, which is insensitive and potentially harmful to those undergoing it.",
